Title

System read
    electrons  6
    nobrillouintheorem
    freeformat
    spin-restrict 0
    nonuniformrandexcits GAS-CI PCHB \
        manual unif:unif full-full:fast-fast
    GAS-SPEC LOCAL 3
        2 2 2
        2 2 2
        2 2 2
        1 2 3 1 2 3 no-recoupling
endsys

calc
    time 30
    seed 7
    load-balance-interval 1000

    definedet 1-2 5-6 9-10

    totalwalkers 1000
    semi-stochastic
    pops-core 10000

    methods
        method vertex fcimc
    endmethods

    diagshift .00
    shiftdamp .02
    nmcyc 100
    stepsshift 10
    proje-changeref 1.20
    truncinitiator
    addtoinitiator  3
    allrealcoeff
    jump-shift
    tau-values  \
        start user-defined 0.01 \
        max 0.02
    tau-search \
        algorithm conventional \
        stop-condition var-shift \
        maxwalkerbloom 1
    memoryfacspawn 10.00
    memoryfacpart 5.00
    startsinglepart 10

endcalc

logging
    highlypopwrite 50
endlog
end

